stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT : create campaign with A/B
  DRAFT --> DRAFT : edit B / READY / simulate / record decision
  DRAFT --> PUBLISHED : publish [decision exists, selected layout is READY and valid]
  PUBLISHED --> DRAFT : withdraw
  PUBLISHED --> ACTIVE : Store Admin activate [recheck eligibility]
  ACTIVE --> ENDED : Store Admin end
  ACTIVE --> ENDED : Store Admin rollback [no previous active campaign]
  ACTIVE --> ENDED : Store Admin rollback [previous campaign restored]
  ENDED --> ACTIVE : rollback restores previously active campaign
  note right of DRAFT
    B is editable only here.
    Simulation is optional and synchronous.
    Each edit creates an immutable layout revision.
  end note
  note right of ACTIVE
    At most one ACTIVE campaign per Store.
    Store-row locking serializes activation and rollback.
  end note
